OL,3,GNEWSA'Taking in my great-grandkids at
OL,4,A74 saved me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pensioner who became a kinship carer
OL,7,Fto prevent her two great-granddaughters
OL,8,Ffrom going into care says she knew she
OL,9,Fhad to do it despite criticism from
OL,10,Fsome friends.
OL,12,FValerie, 74, took responsibility for
OL,13,Fthe girls when her daughter, who had
OL,14,Fbeen looking after them after their own
OL,15,Fparents were unable to, died suddenly.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
