OL,3,GNEWSA'Taking in my great-grandkids at
OL,4,A74 saved me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has been supported by Somerset
OL,7,FCouncil's kinship team and said she
OL,8,Fchose to speak out during Kinship Care
OL,9,FWeek, running until Sunday, to
OL,10,Fhighlight the important but often
OL,11,Finvisible role kinship carers play in
OL,12,Four communities.
OL,14,F"My girls needed me. They've saved me
OL,15,Fas well as me helping them," she said.
